## 0.0.2 (2026-10-30)
- Added WordPress, PHP, and MySQL version columns to the Sites list table.
- Version column headers display icons: the WordPress logo, the PHP logo, and a database icon, registered via the WordPress Icons API (WP 7.1+), with graceful fallback on older versions.
- Version data is read from the MainWP `site_info` option.
- Visible columns can now be chosen via Screen Options on the Sites, Plugins, and Themes list tables.
- CSV export includes the version columns and respects active filters.
- Version columns use compact styling (like the core comments column).
- Added SVG icons in `assets/images/icons/` and updated translation files.

## 0.0.1 (Initial Release)
- Initial release of spectator-role-for-mainwp-dashboard
